      "content": "but it's not just \"struggling,\" it's total erasure. i try to go to my old office or sit in a cafe and i can literally feel the eyes on me. i know what they're thinking. they look at me and they see a predator, a fraud, a nothing. there's no coming back from this. even if i apologized a thousand times, the internet has already decided who i am. the person i used to be is dead and buried under all this hate. i'm just a shell now.",
