      "content": "it's not permanent though. you don't get it. i've tried to move on, but every time i step outside, it's like i'm being hunted. there is no version of the future where things go back to normal. i'm just trapped in this life that everyone hates, dragging around a reputation i can't fix. it feels like i'm just waiting for the clock to run out, but the waiting is the most exhausting part. it's like i'm already a ghost, so why am i still forced to pretend i'm actually here?",
      "source": "evaluator"
